          ],
          "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/assets/img/workflows/merge-refusal.svg",
          "description": "What a merge steward does with a PR it dropped from a merge train: its merge (`merge-base.bpmn`, run with `--no-regen`) refused an authored or undeclared conflict, or the train's combined result failed a gate. Owner, 2026-10-02: \"create a new bean (under appropriate epic/story…), hand it back to the sibling (use the agent-to-agent handoff process with a fail condition) for resolution, or dispatch an agent as appropriate.\" Bean `zacz`; the discipline is in `merge-conflict-patterns` §\"When a merge-train member is refused\".\n\nONE INSTANCE PER REFUSED PR, started with `bean:` set to the refusal bean. The steward finds or creates that bean BEFORE starting the instance, because creating a bean is the agent's own `beans create` call, deduplicated by the PR number in its title; the engine has no create op (`bean-lifecycle.bpmn`). A second refusal of the same PR loops back into this instance rather than opening a second bean.",
          "enforcement": "strict",
          "flowCount": 27,
          "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/directory/sdlc",
          "name": "A refused merge-train member",
          "nodeCount": 23,
          "sourcePath": "sdlc/processes/merge-refusal.bpmn",
          "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/cat-harness/blob/main/sdlc/processes/merge-refusal.bpmn",
          "startNode": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/process/Process_MergeRefusal/node/Start_Refused",
          "summary": "What a merge steward does with a PR it dropped from a merge train: its merge (`merge-base.bpmn`, run with `--no-regen`) refused an authored or undeclared conflict, or the train's combined result failed a gate."
        },
