          "startNode": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/process/Process_UpstreamPinWatch/node/Start_Sweep",
          "summary": "Has a pinned upstream dependency fallen behind a release: check each pin, keep one tracking issue, and enter the adoption subprocess for each dependency that is behind."
